{"candidateAnswer":"Catan","evidence":"[D16:2 | 10:55 am on 24 June, 2022] Nate: That's really cool Joanna! I hope it does well, and I've been doing great! The gaming party was a great success! We even played some Chess afterward just for fun.\n[D23:7 | 10:58 am on 9 October, 2022] Nate: We played this game Catan - it's a great strategy game where you build settlements and trade resources. I love it!","itemId":"urn:uuid:2e488bfd-2976-5d0a-a03b-6280c7b302bd","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1900132e6a99b625ac5e2faa6ebd44e832d09e5f23a9f347fcd230f5e7a978f3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What board games has Nate played?","referenceAnswer":"Chess, Catan.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1900132e6a99b625ac5e2faa6ebd44e832d09e5f23a9f347fcd230f5e7a978f3"}}]}